{"updated":"2026-11-06T21:42:19.804Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Global stocks fall amid ‘big worries over AI’ after Democrats’ midterms triumph. Elsewhere, pope Leo arrives in Uruguay for first stop on 12-day South America tour. And AI stocks climb after trillions wiped from market values. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 5.7 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 0.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 10.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 31 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.1 near 144 km SE of Hasaki, Japan. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.13,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.3,0.36,0.41,0.44,0.49,0.53,0.57,0.6,0.64,0.66,0.71,0.84,0.93,1.06,1.44,1.56,1.6,1.63,1.65,1.7,1.72,1.74,1.76,1.82,1.87,1.94,2.01,2.06,2.09,2.13,2.17,2.21,2.24,2.3,2.36,2.4,2.44,2.5,2.53,2.59,2.63,2.69,2.76,2.83,2.9,3.02,3.11,3.26,3.29,3.33,3.37,3.42,3.47,3.53,3.65,3.73,3.79,3.85,3.9,3.95,3.99,4.04,4.09,4.11,4.13,4.18,4.2,4.23,4.25,4.3,4.34,4.42,4.48,4.55,4.63,4.69,4.81,4.84,4.9,4.92,4.98,5.1,5.25,5.42,5.93,6.01,6.08,6.17,6.22,6.29,6.33,6.4,6.44,6.53,6.64,6.69,6.75,6.83,6.94,7.04,7.19,7.25,7.29,7.36,7.41,7.45,7.52,7.58,7.62,7.65,7.71,7.8,7.86,7.94,7.99,8.06,8.12,8.17,8.22,8.28,8.32,8.38,8.5,8.54,8.59,8.63,8.71,9.03,9.15,9.32,9.45,9.58,9.65,9.71,9.75,9.78,9.85,9.89,9.95,10.01,10.06,10.12,10.18,10.24,10.31,10.36,10.39,10.44,10.48,10.55,10.61,10.7,10.8,10.86,10.94,11.01,11.06,11.13,11.21,11.33,11.4,11.44,11.51,11.59,11.76,12.14,12.26,12.32,12.39,12.45,12.48,12.54,12.57,12.63,12.76,12.8,12.93,13,13.12,13.18,13.23,13.26,13.3,13.42,13.54,13.61,13.65,13.71,13.77,13.88,13.94,13.99,14.01,14.06,14.09,14.13,14.2,14.28,14.35,14.41,14.47